 vocals, sweeping long string pads, majestic uplifting melody, wide reverb, solemn magnificent atmosphere, dramatic dynamic contrast, no thin electronic sounds, full orchestral arrangement, compact 1-minute structure with continuous emotional escalation, heroic solemn vibe.", "[Intro]（8s 管弦起，鼓声渐起）\n长风穿千嶂 云海漫城郭\n天地铺开一卷山河\n[Verse 1]（16s）\n踏破霜雪行过万里荒漠\n孤峰矗立承接日月起落\n凡俗目光困于方寸楼阁\n未见天地辽阔\n[Pre-Chorus]（8s 情绪爬升，弦乐加厚）\n胸中藏万顷星河\n何惧前路风波\n[Chorus]（18s 全编制爆发，大合唱）\n举目望 群山巍峨\n浪潮奔涌冲破壁垒阻隔\n以风骨 立此山河\n纵前路苍茫亦不曾退缩\n揽日月 同我高歌\n千秋浩荡 万古皆同辙\n[Outro]（10s 乐器缓缓收束，悠远和声收尾）\n山河永在 长风不歇", 302934198755327, "fixed", 92, 60, "4", "zh", "D major", true, 3.5, 0.8000000000000002, 0.9, 0, 0], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 261, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 257, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "bpm"}, "name": "bpm", "label": "bpm", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "bpm"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "link": 251, "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "timesignature"}, "name": "timesignature", "label": "timesignature", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "timesignature"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "language"}, {"widget": {"name": "keyscale"}, "name": "keyscale", "label": "keyscale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "keyscale"}, {"widget": {"name": "generate_audio_codes"}, "name": "generate_audio_codes", "label": "generate_audio_codes", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "generate_audio_codes"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_p"}, "name": "min_p", "label": "min_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "min_p"}], "flags": {}, "id": 94, "type": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.11.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"duration": true, "seed": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"duration": true, "seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["🎵 ACE 1.5 音乐生成节点：全参数通俗指南\n这个节点是音乐生成的“指挥官”，负责把你的想法变成声音。\n\n1️⃣ 文本输入区 (核心意图)\n上方框 (风格描述)：决定曲风。\n例： K-Pop, High Energy, Synth-pop (快节奏、合成器流行)。\n下方框 (歌词与结构)：\n用 [Intro] (前奏)、[Verse] (主歌)、[Chorus] (副歌) 来分段。\n词写得越密，AI 唱得越快。\n\n\n\n2️⃣ 基础属性 (物理参数)\nbpm (速度)：\n120-130：标准流行、跳舞节奏。\n140-190：极快，适合 Trap 或高能舞曲（图中 190 是极速）。\n80-100：慢歌、R&B。\n\ntimesignature (拍号)：\n设为 4 即可（绝大多数流行歌都是 4/4 拍）。\nlanguage (语言)：\n选 en (英) 或 zh (中)。注意： 必须和你写的歌词语言匹配！\n\nkeyscale (调式)：\nMajor (大调)：听起来开心、阳光。\nMinor (小调)：听起来酷、忧郁、悲伤（图中 E Minor 适合酷炫风格）。\n\n\n\n3️⃣ AI 生成控制 (精细调校)\ncfg_scale (提示词遵循度)：推荐值 2.0 - 4.0\n调高：AI 会拼命去靠拢你的风格描述，但太高声音会嘶哑。\n调低：给 AI 自由发挥空间，声音更自然但可能不听话。\n\ntemperature (温度/随机性)：推荐值 0.8 - 0.9\n调高：更有创意，旋律更跳跃，但太高会乱唱跑调。\n调低：更保守平稳，不容易出错但可能显得无聊。\n\ntop_p (采样阈值)：推荐值 0.8 - 0.95\n控制声音生成的清晰度。如果觉得声音很杂乱，稍微调低它（比如 0.8）。\n\ntop_k：\n通常设为 0。这是一种硬限制，设为 0 表示交给 top_p 处理。\n💡 参数调整秘籍 (遇到问题怎么办)\n\n问题：音乐太吵、有噪音？\n👉 降低 cfg_scale（降到 1.5 左右）。\n👉 降低 temperature（降到 0.7 左右）。\n\n问题：AI 唱得乱七八糟？\n👉 检查 language 是否选对。\n👉 降低 top_p（降到 0.8）。\n\n问题：想做很炸、很酷的音乐？\n👉 bpm 调到 140 以上。\n👉 keyscale 选 Minor (小调)。\n\n问题：想做阳光、温柔的音乐？\n👉 bpm 调到 80-100。\n👉 keyscale 选 Major (大调)。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "参数解读", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [1045.7022705078125, 361.1905822753906], "pos": [-1254.813720703125, -56.54836654663086], "id": 109, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["1. 轻松听感 / 泽西俱乐部风 (Easy Listening / Jersey Club)\n这是目前最火的风格（参考 NewJeans），听感轻盈、复古且极其洗脑。\n\nPrompt:\nChill Easy Listening Pop: A breezy, nostalgic track blending Jersey Club rhythms with smooth 2-step garage beats. The production features minimalist electric piano plucks and airy synth pads, leading to a breathy, melodic verse with rhythmic vocal chops, and a bright, infectious chorus with a dreamy, repetitive vocal hook.\n\n中文解读：\n轻松听感流行：一种清新、怀旧的曲轨，融合了 Jersey Club 节奏和丝滑的 2-step garage 律动。制作上采用极简的电钢琴拨音和空灵的合成器铺底，引导出呼吸感十足、带有节奏感人声切片的旋律性主歌，以及拥有梦幻、洗脑重复人声钩子的明亮副歌。\n\n\n\n2. 未来赛博 / 工业女孩风 (Futuristic Cyber / Metallic Girl Crush)\n极具力量感和实验性（参考 aespa / BabyMonster），适合硬核说唱和爆发性副歌。\n\nPrompt:\nFuturistic Cyber-Pop: A heavy-hitting, experimental track with metallic textures and hyper-pop influences. Features a dark, bass-heavy trap verse with aggressive rap delivery and glitchy percussion, shifting into a high-tension cinematic pre-chorus, and culminating in an explosive, distorted synth-layered chorus with a powerful, anthem-like melody.\n\n中文解读：\n未来感赛博流行：一种重击感强、具有金属质感和 Hyper-pop 影响的实验性曲轨。包含暗黑、重低音的 Trap 主歌，配合激进的说唱和破碎感打击乐，转向高张力的电影感预副歌，最后在扭曲合成器堆叠的爆发式副歌中达到高潮，伴有力量感十足、如赞歌般的旋律。\n\n\n\n3. 复古迪斯科 / 现代摇摆 (Retro Nu-Disco / High-Fashion Pop)\n优雅、时尚且律动感极强（参考 IVE / Dua Lipa），适合展现都市感。\n\nPrompt:\nRetro Nu-Disco Pop: A groovy, high-fashion track centered around a funky slap bassline and glittering disco strings. The verse is rhythmic and sleek with rhythmic talk-singing, moving into a lushly harmonized R&B bridge with elegant piano, followed by a sparkling, 80s-inspired synth chorus that feels both nostalgic and modernly polished.\n\n中文解读：\n复古新迪斯科：一种充满律动感和时尚感的曲轨，以强力的电贝斯（Slap Bass）和闪亮的迪斯科弦乐为核心。主歌节奏感强且干练，伴有节奏感十足的说唱式唱法，衔接至钢琴伴奏、和声丰富的 R&B 桥段，随后进入充满 80 年代色彩的闪亮合成器副歌，兼具怀旧感与现代精致感。\n\n\n\n4. 非洲律动 / 热带夏日风 (Afrobeats-Infused / Tropical Pop)\n当下的全球趋势（参考 LE SSERAFIM 的 Smart），节奏感极其强烈且性感。\n\nPrompt:\nAfrobeats-Infused Pop: A vibrant, rhythmic track driven by hypnotic percussion and earthy basslines. The verse features a laid-back, melodic flow with organic percussive accents, transitioning into a sultry, low-register pre-chorus, and ending in a dance-ready, tropical synth chorus with a repetitive, rhythmic vocal loop and bouncy rhythm.\n\n中文解读：\n非洲律动流行：一种充满活力、由催眠般的打击乐和厚实贝斯驱动的节奏曲轨。主歌展现慵懒且带有旋律感的流向，并伴有原声打击乐点缀，过渡到性感的低音区预副歌，最后以极具舞蹈感的、热带风情的合成器副歌收尾，带有重复的节奏人声循环和富有弹性的节奏。\n\n\n\n5. 电影感感性流行 / 摇滚抒情 (Cinematic Emotional / Pop-Rock Ballad)\n大气、有故事感（参考 太妍 / IU），适合展现唱功和情绪起伏。\n\nPrompt:\nCinematic Emotional Pop: A grand, storytelling track that starts with an intimate acoustic piano and soft strings. The production builds gradually from a delicate, storytelling verse to a lush, orchestral pre-chorus with soaring harmonies, peaking in a high-energy, pop-rock influenced chorus with powerful live drums and distorted guitar accents.\n\n中文解读：\n电影感感性流行：一首宏大的叙事性曲轨，以亲密的钢琴和柔和的弦乐开场。制作从细腻的叙事性主歌逐渐递进到管弦乐伴奏、和声高亢的预副歌，最终在充满力量感、受流行摇滚影响的副歌中达到巅峰，伴有强力的现场鼓点和失真吉他点缀。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "风格参考", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [730.378662109375, 659.3405151367188], "pos": [-1517.740478515625, 384.8818664550781], "id": 110, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["🎼 ACE 1.5 节拍与调性选择速查指南\n1. 节拍选择 (Time Signature) —— 决定歌曲的“律动感”\n节拍决定了一小节里有几拍，直接影响听众想怎么抖腿。\n\n【4】（4/4拍）- 万能流行拍\n感觉：最稳、最标准。动-次-打-次。\n适用：90% 的流行歌、说唱 (Rap)、舞曲、摇滚。如果你不知道选哪个，就选 4。\n\n\n【3】（3/4拍）- 圆舞曲拍\n感觉：蹦-恰-恰，有旋转感、优雅、像在跳华尔兹。\n适用：古典风格、三拍子民谣、抒情慢歌。\n\n\n【2】（2/4拍）- 进行曲拍\n感觉：左右-左右，非常规整、有力。\n适用：儿歌、行进军乐、节奏极快的极简电子。\n\n\n【6】（6/8拍）- 摇摆感拍\n感觉：像在秋千上晃动，比 3 拍更连贯、更抒情。\n适用：唯美古风、深情蓝调 (Blues)、大气磅礴的史诗抒情曲。\n\n\n\n\n2. 曲调选择 (Keys & Scales) —— 决定歌曲的“情绪底色”\n调性就像滤镜，大调是阳光，小调是月光。\n\n\n☀️ 大调 (Major) —— 开心、明亮、正能量\n情绪：快乐、希望、力量、辉煌、坚定。\n例子：\nC大调：最纯净、最基础，适合各种欢快的儿歌或纯净流行。\nG/D大调：非常明亮，适合民谣、吉他弹唱，听起来很有生命力。\n\n\n🌙 小调 (Minor) —— 忧郁、酷炫、有故事\n情绪：悲伤、神秘、冷酷、怀旧、走心。\n例子：\nA小调：经典的忧郁，适合伤感情歌。\nE/B小调：听起来很“拽”或者很“暗黑”，非常适合说唱 (Rap) 和 硬核 K-Pop。\n\n\n#（升号）与 b（降号）：\n只是起音的高低不同，不需要深究。如果你的歌词很励志，选大调；如果你的歌词很伤感或很酷，选小调。\n\n\n\n💡 快速搭配配方（直接套用）：\n\n要做【高燃/酷炫 K-Pop 说唱】：\n节拍：4\n调性：E小调 (E minor) 或 G#小调 (G# minor)\n\n\n要做【甜美/阳光 少女风】：\n节拍：4\n调性：C大调 (C major) 或 F大调 (F major)\n\n\n要做【深情/催泪 苦情歌】：\n节拍：4 或 6\n调性：A小调 (A minor) 或 D小调 (D minor)\n\n\n要做【复古/优雅 华尔兹】：\n节拍：3\n调性：G大调 (G major)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "节拍和曲调", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [712.770751953125, 445.561767578125], "pos": [-760.7508544921875, 390.7437744140625], "id": 111, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.38.13", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1805.701895956707, -11.575925541706614], "scale": 1.0610764609500023}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Step 1 - Load Models", "bounding": [-180, -860, 405, 461.6000061035156]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Step 2 - Duration", "bounding": [-180, -370, 400, 170]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "Step3 - Prompt", "bounding": [260, -860, 640, 960]}], "links": [[119, 47, 0, 3, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [175, 78, 0, 3, 0, "MODEL"], [249, 98, 0, 3, 3, "LATENT"], [250, 99, 0, 98, 0, "FLOAT"], [251, 99, 0, 94, 5, "FLOAT"], [254, 94, 0, 3, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [255, 94, 0, 47, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [256, 3, 0, 18, 0, "LATENT"], [257, 102, 0, 94, 3, "INT"], [258, 102, 0, 3, 4, "INT"], [261, 105, 0, 94, 0, "CLIP"], [262, 106, 0, 18, 1, "VAE"], [269, 18, 0, 118, 0, "AUDIO"], [270, 104, 0, 78, 0, "MODEL"]], "id": "88ac5dad-efd7-40bb-84fe-fbaefdee1fa9", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 118, "revision": 0}